description:
Implement an `atom` factory and a `useAtom` hook inspired by Jotai. Each atom is a standalone unit of state that can be shared across components. The setter accepts either a new value or an updater function.

**Example:**
```tsx
const countAtom = atom(0);

function Counter() {
  const [count, setCount] = useAtom(countAtom);
  return (
    <>
      <span>{count}</span>
      <button onClick={() => setCount(c => c + 1)}>+</button>
    </>
  );
}

function Display() {
  const [count] = useAtom(countAtom);
  return <span>Count: {count}</span>; // shared state
}
```

